  m_text: "A script is a C# file. Spinner.cs is an asset in the Project window. Added to a GameObject, the same file becomes a component, beside the Transform and the Mesh Renderer. While the component is on, Unity runs its method Update every frame, and the cube turns. Switch it off, and the cube stops.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You untick Spinner on Cube 1 while the game runs. Does Angle, in the Inspector, keep changing?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play. Select Cube 1. Open Tools \u203A Mavrodiev \u203A Code Watch.\n2. In the Inspector, untick Spinner, then tick it again.\n3. Click the Script field of Spinner: the file lights up in the Project window."
